# Captured baselines are machine-specific: the ONNX embedder and
# cross-encoder reranker are not bit-exact across CPU ISAs, so a
# baseline captured on aarch64 will drift on x86_64 even with
# identical code. To prevent operators on non-reference architectures
# from accidentally committing baselines that would corrupt the gate
# for everyone else, ignore everything in this directory by default.
#
# To commit a reference-architecture baseline, override with
#   git add -f packages/eval/src/memex_eval/suites/retrieval_stability/baselines/<scenario_id>.json
# This forces a deliberate decision about which architecture is
# canonical for the regression gate.
*.json
*.json.tmp
